[gd_scene format=3]

; Moves one variable: the child nodes of a y-sorted TileMapLayer. Each child sorts among the layer's
; tile rows by its y plus its y_sort_origin, so the cyan and yellow children draw over row 0 and
; under row 1. No other scene gives a y-sorted layer a child, so none shows the order. The left
; layer is the root of a sort. The right layer is lifted into a y-sorted Node2D's flat sort.

[ext_resource type="Texture2D" path="res://textures/atlas-quadrants.png" id="1_atlas"]

